**What Makes Our New AI Powered Character Counter Unique...**

**1. Set Your Target Limit:**You can set your target limit in words or
character and monitor your progress against that target. 

**2. Real Time Highlighting: **It's the only tool available that
provides real-time text highlighting as you exceed your target character
count, just like the visual representation of character limits on
Twitter. 

**3. AI to Edit Your Text to Target Length (you can't do this well with
ChatGPT):**It uses AI to precisely adjust your text to meet your
desired character or word count. Unlike using ChatGPT, which often falls
short when attempting to generate content within specific limits, our
tool edits text to an accurate word/character count. 

....Best of all, it's completely free, no email needed and ad-free!

**Other cool features...**

* Popular pre-set character limits

* Easy-to-see displays that highlight if you are measuring against words
or characters

* Ability to adjust the intent of the AI output

